2. Objective and References
Objective
The objective of this test plan is to define the planned verification approach for
the VWO Digital Experience Optimization Platform against the functional, non
functional, business, and workflow requirements documented in the supplied
PRD.
Testing will focus on determining whether the documented capabilities support:
Experiment creation and execution.
Statistical result analysis through SmartStats.
Behavioral insights such as heatmaps and session recordings.
Audience targeting and personalization.
Reporting and dashboards.
External integrations.
Collaboration and workflow management.
Applicable performance, security, scalability, privacy, and reliability
requirements.
The PRD identifies the primary business objectives as improving conversion
rates, validating UX hypotheses using empirical data, reducing engineering
dependency, and providing unified insights. 
