Defect Triage
Proposed severity:
Critical: Core business capability unavailable or severe data/security
impact.
High: Major documented functionality fails with significant business impact.
Medium: Functionality is impaired but workaround exists.
Low: Minor functional/UI issue with limited impact.
These severity definitions are proposed, not specified in the PRD.
Reporting Cadence
Proposed:
Daily execution/defect update during active testing.
Defect triage at least once per business day.
Test summary at test completion.
Frequency and participants require stakeholder agreement.
Defect Lifecycle
New → Triaged → Assigned → Fixed → Retest → Closed
Possible additional states:
Rejected / Duplicate / Deferred / Cannot Reproduce
